  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Third party monitoring of Africa Regional Department programmes to inform improvements to programme delivery and reporting by implementing partners.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Third party monitoring of Africa Regional Department programmes to inform improvements to programme delivery and reporting by implementing partners. is a component of Africa Programmes and Expertise Department Cross-Portfolio Third Party Monitoring (TPM) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;2,127,539. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Health policy and administrative management, Environmental policy and administrative management, Facilitation of orderly, safe, regular and responsible migration and mobility, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Trade policy and administrative management, Transport policy and administrative management, Research/scientific institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
